      "content": "it's easy to say \"keep going\" but i'm just tired. i'm so incredibly tired of fighting an uphill battle that i was never supposed to win. every time i try to stand up for something decent, it just costs me more than i have to give. it feels like i'm just drowning in a sea of people who don't care. i honestly don't see a version of the future where anything actually gets better. it just feels like the most logical conclusion is to just... stop. to just stop fighting and let it all go.",
